---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Technical Writing | Harry Sivasambu" description="Research-driven essays on systems, AI, and financial literacy.">
  <h1 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 34px;">Technical Writing</h1>
  <p style="margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--muted);">
    Notes on system design, healthcare integrations, and cloud architecture, focused on how real-world constraints shape technical decisions.
  </p>
  <p style="margin: 0 0 14px; color: var(--muted);">
    Most articles are grounded in patterns I've seen in production healthcare systems and adapted into modern architectures.
  </p>
  <div style="display: grid; gap: 12px;">
    <div class="card">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: var(--accent);">Designing Event Pipelines That Don't Break Under Load</h2>
        <span class="pill">System Design</span>
      </div>
      <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: var(--muted);">
        How real systems fail under load, and the patterns used to handle backpressure, retries, and recovery in event-driven architectures.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: var(--accent);">Designing AI Systems That Know When to Escalate</h2>
        <span class="pill">AI Developments</span>
      </div>
      <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: var(--muted);">
        Where AI systems break down in practice, and how to design escalation paths that balance automation with human oversight.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: var(--accent);">How Financial Constraints Shape System Design</h2>
        <span class="pill">Financial Literacy</span>
      </div>
      <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: var(--muted);">
        The financial decisions that shape technical systems — from cost constraints to tradeoffs between speed, scale, and sustainability.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
